---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="工作桌">

    <section class="studio" aria-labelledby="welcome" data-screen-label="个人工作桌">
      <div class="eyebrow studio-meta">
<span>A SMALL SPACE ON THE INTERNET</span>
<span>SHENZHEN · KENNY'S STUDIO</span>
</div>
      <div class="intro">
<div>
<p class="hello">你好，我是 Kenny。</p>
<h1 id="welcome">留一点空间，<br>给<span class="ink-word">思考。</span>
</h1>
<p class="lede">我做 AI 工具，写研究笔记，<br>也试着把一闪而过的想法，变成能留下来的东西。</p>
</div>
<div class="walking">
<img src="/assets/img/practices/walk.png" alt="散步中的 Kenny 插画" width="1254" height="1254">
<span class="handwritten">thinking in motion</span>
</div>
</div>
      <div class="desk-label">
<span class="eyebrow">ON MY DESK</span>
<span>随意翻翻。每件东西都可以打开。<span aria-hidden="true"> ↙</span>
</span>
</div>
      <div class="desk">
        <a class="object tool" href="#playground">
<span class="object-meta">正在打磨的工具 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</span>
<h2>Clipplane<span class="dot">.</span>
</h2>
<p>把值得留下的那句话，<br>先放回自己的电脑。</p>
<div class="mini-capture" aria-hidden="true">
<span>read → select → keep</span>
<div>
<mark>Keep what matters.</mark>
<span class="clip-symbol">＋</span>
</div>
</div>
<span class="object-link">亲手收集一句话 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</span>
</a>
        <button class="object notebook" type="button" data-open="notes-dialog">
<span class="object-meta">翻开的研究笔记 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</span>
<span class="notebook-title">AI 应该<br>记住什么？</span>
<span class="notebook-copy">存储、检索，以及必要的遗忘。</span>
<span class="note-lines" aria-hidden="true">
</span>
<span class="object-link">从一个问题开始 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</span>
</button>
        <button class="object life" type="button" data-open="life-dialog">
<span class="object-meta">屏幕以外 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</span>
<img src="/assets/img/practices/listen.png" alt="坐在藤椅里听音乐的 Kenny" width="1254" height="1254">
<span class="object-link">给注意力放个假 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</span>
</button>
      </div>
      <div class="desk-bottom">
<span>Tools for thought. Room for life.</span>
<a href="#playground">往下走，动手试试 ↓</a>
</div>
    </section>
    <section class="playground section" id="playground" aria-labelledby="play-title" data-screen-label="Clipplane 交互演示">
      <div class="section-heading">
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">A TOOL YOU CAN TOUCH</span>
<h2 id="play-title">好想法，值得被留下。</h2>
</div>
<span class="demo-label">Clipplane · 示例演示</span>
</div>
      <p class="section-description">在短文中选中一句话，再把它放进收集区。感受一次从阅读到留存的过程。</p>
      <div class="demo">
        <article class="reading-pane">
<div class="pane-label">
<span>01 / READ & SELECT</span>
<span>示例短文</span>
</div>
<h3>收集之后，<br>思考才刚刚开始。</h3>
<div id="sample">
<p>我们每天读到很多东西。真正留下来的，往往只有一句让自己停顿的话。</p>
<p>收集的意义，不是把互联网再存一遍。<span id="sample-quote">好的工具，应该让想法回到你手里，而不是困在另一个收件箱里。</span>
</p>
<p>先留下原句和出处。等到下一次需要它时，你还可以沿着线索，回到当时的问题。</p>
</div>
<div class="reading-actions">
<button id="select-example" class="text-button" type="button">帮我选一句 ↗</button>
<button id="capture" class="primary" type="button">收进来 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</button>
</div>
<p id="selection-status" class="selection-status" role="status">可以拖选文字，也可以点「帮我选一句」。</p>
</article>
        <div class="inbox-pane">
<div class="pane-label">
<span>02 / KEEP</span>
<span id="count">0 条片段</span>
</div>
<div id="empty" class="empty">
<span class="empty-mark" aria-hidden="true">[　]</span>
<h3>留一个位置，<br>给刚刚的触动。</h3>
<p>你选中的文字，会出现在这里。</p>
</div>
<div id="captured" hidden>
<span class="saved-label">✓ 已收进本次演示</span>
<blockquote id="saved-quote">
</blockquote>
<p class="source-line">出处 · 收集之后，思考才刚刚开始。<br>来源保留，线索不断。</p>
<div class="saved-actions">
<button id="undo" class="text-button" type="button">撤销收集 ↶</button>
<button id="reset" class="text-button" type="button">重新体验 ↺</button>
</div>
</div>
<p class="demo-boundary">仅演示选文收集；不连接扩展，不上传内容，刷新后清空。</p>
</div>
      </div>
      <a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/KKenny0/Clipplane" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">了解真正的 Clipplane <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</a>
    </section>
    <section class="now section" id="now" aria-labelledby="now-title" data-screen-label="此刻在意的事">
      <div class="now-intro">
<span class="eyebrow">A NOTE FROM HERE</span>
<h2 id="now-title">此刻，<br>在意这些事。</h2>
<p>做一点。读一点。<br>给没想明白的事留个位置。</p>
<span class="draft">本次更新 · <time datetime="2026-09-05">2026.09.05</time>
</span>
</div>
      <div class="now-notes">
<details open>
<summary>
<span class="now-kind">MAKING</span>
<span>让个人主页成为可以逛的空间</span>
<span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
</summary>
<p>从一张工作桌、一次可玩的收集体验开始，让作品有入口，也让生活露出一点边角。</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>
<span class="now-kind">PONDERING</span>
<span>什么值得被 AI 记住？</span>
<span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
</summary>
<p>从已有的记忆系统研究继续往下问：什么该保留，什么该遗忘，谁来做这个决定？</p>
<button class="text-button" data-open="notes-dialog" type="button">翻开相关笔记 →</button>
</details>
<details>
<summary>
<span class="now-kind">OFFLINE</span>
<span>听、读、走一走</span>
<span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
</summary>
<p>听一点音乐，读几页书，走一段路。给注意力留一点屏幕以外的空间。</p>
<button class="text-button" data-open="life-dialog" type="button">去屏幕以外坐坐 →</button>
</details>
</div>
    </section>
  <dialog id="notes-dialog" aria-labelledby="notes-title">
<div class="dialog-top">
<span class="eyebrow">AN OPEN NOTEBOOK</span>
<form method="dialog">
<button class="close" aria-label="关闭笔记">×</button>
</form>
</div>
<h2 id="notes-title">AI 应该记住什么？</h2>
<p class="dialog-lede">一个问题，几条继续往下走的线索。</p>
<a class="note-link" href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2046699626565219617" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
<span>01 · 从记忆开始</span>
<strong>ChatGPT 的 Dreaming 记忆做了什么 ↗</strong>
<small>存储、检索与遗忘的工程挑战。</small>
</a>
<a class="note-link" href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2036754568097296982" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
<span>02 · 看系统怎样工作</span>
<strong>Session、Context 和 Memory 管理机制 ↗</strong>
<small>AI 编程助手如何管理工作状态。</small>
</a>
<a class="note-link" href="/projects/#tracework" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
<span>03 · 走向一个工具</span>
<strong>Tracework ↗</strong>
<small>让工作留下理由，也留下可追溯的证据。</small>
</a>
</dialog>
<dialog id="life-dialog" aria-labelledby="life-title">
<div class="dialog-top">
<span class="eyebrow">OUTSIDE THE TERMINAL</span>
<form method="dialog">
<button class="close" aria-label="关闭生活角落">×</button>
</form>
</div>
<div class="life-content">
<img src="/assets/img/practices/read.png" alt="Kenny 正在阅读和批注" width="1254" height="1254">
<div>
<h2 id="life-title">有时候，<br>先离开屏幕。</h2>
<p>听一点音乐，翻几页书，走一段路。给注意力换一种节奏。</p>
<p class="small">Listen · Read · Walk · Return</p>
<a class="text-button" href="/about/">再认识我一点 ↗</a>
</div>
</div>
</dialog>
<script>import '../scripts/capture-demo.js';</script>
</BaseLayout>
